# Google Apps Script web app that counts prompt copies.
# Deploy scripts/copy-counter.gs (setup steps are in the file header) and paste
# the /exec URL here. Leave it unset to hide the counter entirely.
#
# Server-only: the browser reaches the counter through /api/prompt-copies and
# never sees this address. NEXT_PUBLIC_COPY_COUNTER_URL is still read as a
# fallback for deployments configured before that route existed, but it exposes
# the URL to every visitor — prefer the name below.
COPY_COUNTER_URL=

# Manat Zaman Maşını (fuadev.com/manat) is a separate Next.js app served as a
# zone. Point this at its deployment (no trailing slash); locally, at its dev
# server, e.g. http://localhost:3123. Leave unset to disable /manat.
MANAT_ORIGIN=
